        <mxCell id="uO9gtoDcMiCFNgQkHLEk-60" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=15;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(28, 30, 33); color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;The Tool Use metric is a multi-turn agentic metric that evaluates whether your LLM agent&#39;s&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: var(--ifm-font-weight-bold); caret-color: rgb(28, 30, 33); color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;&quot;&gt;tool selection and argument generation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(28, 30, 33); color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;capablilities. It is a self-explaining eval, which means it outputs a reason for its metric score.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="780" x="820" y="1385" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uO9gtoDcMiCFNgQkHLEk-61" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(28, 30, 33); color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14.4px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;The argument correctness metric is an agentic LLM metric that assesses your LLM agent&#39;s ability to generate the correct arguments for the tools it calls. It is calculated by determining whether the arguments for each tool call is correct based on the input.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="650" x="830" y="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uO9gtoDcMiCFNgQkHLEk-63" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(28, 30, 33); color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14.4px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;The Plan Adherence metric is an agentic metric that extracts the task and plan from your agent&#39;s trace which are then used to evaluate&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: var(--ifm-font-weight-bold); caret-color: rgb(28, 30, 33); color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14.4px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;&quot;&gt;how well your agent has adhered to the plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(28, 30, 33); color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Symbol&amp;quot;; font-size: 14.4px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;in completing the task. It is a self-explaining eval, which means it outputs a reason for its metric score&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="650" x="830" y="630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
